Hello! We are starting a series of video tutorials that will help you prepare for participation in the robotics festival. We will examine in detail the basic things related to programming microcontrollers in the Arduino IDE, designing 3D models of various parts. We will examine the basics of working with a 3D printer and a laser cutting machine. We will pay attention to the features associated with each direction of the festival - these are competitions of mobile robots and unmanned aerial vehicles and a polytechnic Olympiad.